{%- comment -%} Indoor sensor from the markup's own merge variable sensor_readings (TRMNL adds it at render time, the transform never sees it): the newest reading of temperature and humidity of this screen's own device (device_<trmnl.device.id>, no other device's sensor; no id: no indoor reading). Another TRMNL with a number that matches no device: this screen's own device (owner 2026-11-15, TRMNL saves the form without the number), none when over 3 h older than the render time. Then ph (the payload's small overlay: the BINNEN readout, the humidity twin meter's key) applies: inn is its readout, ph_tw the key of the meter that gets a twin; the page script merges the same overlay into SW and puts the real values in. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ml = ui.meters %}{% assign inm = true %}{% if ph.im == false %}{% assign inm = false %}{% endif %}{% if ph %}{% assign i_w = ph.id | default: trmnl.device.id | append: '' %}{% if i_w != '' %}{% assign i_k = 'device_' | append: i_w %}{% assign i_o = 'device_' | append: trmnl.device.id %}{% for d in sensor_readings %}{% if d[1].temperature.size > 0 %}{% if d[0] == i_k %}{% assign i_d = d[1] %}{% elsif d[0] == i_o %}{% assign i_f = d[1] %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if i_d == nil %}{% assign i_d = i_f %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
{%- assign i_q = 'temperature,humidity,carbon_dioxide' | split: ',' %}{% for q in i_q %}{% assign i_m = 0 %}{% assign i_v = nil %}{% assign i_l = i_d[q] %}{% for e in i_l %}{% assign kv = e | first %}{% assign s = kv[0] | date: '%s' | plus: 0 %}{% if s > i_m %}{% assign i_m = s %}{% assign i_v = kv[1] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% assign i_a = trmnl.system.timestamp_utc | minus: i_m %}{% if i_a > 10800 %}{% assign i_v = nil %}{% endif %}{% if forloop.index == 1 %}{% assign i_t = i_v %}{% elsif forloop.index == 2 %}{% assign i_h = i_v %}{% else %}{% assign i_c = i_v %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- comment -%} B22: an indoor source other than a TRMNL sensor (ph.sx, read and cleaned by the transform: Celsius, percent, ppm, already checked for age) takes the place of sensor_readings; the rest below is the same path. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- if ph.sx %}{% assign i_t = ph.sx.t %}{% assign i_h = ph.sx.h %}{% assign i_c = ph.sx.c %}{% endif %}
{%- if i_t != nil and ph.inn %}{% assign inn = ph.inn %}{% assign inn_hum = ph.inn.hum %}{% if i_h != nil %}{% assign ph_tw = ph.tw.k %}{% else %}{% assign inn_hum = '' %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
{%- if i_c != nil and ph.mn %}{% assign ml = ph.mn %}{% elsif i_t != nil and i_h != nil and ph.hn %}{% assign ml = ph.hn %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
